# Its id leads with aspect-: a State of the same name (Raging, Mindful, God Ki) has the bare one.
id: aspect-weakening
name: Weakening
polarity: negative
# number: its script is the whole of it. moment: entering, leaving, the start of a turn (stages 4-5).
# rule: how a Transformation is entered, left or Mastered - asked by transformations.mjs aspectLevel.
group: number
# The rule in short, for its hovers; its own words below (the page the user gave, 2026-11-20).
summary: >
  With Ki Points below 1/4 of the Maximum, its Attribute Bonuses are halved (after every calculation); not if entered through Heartbeat.
text: >
  Weakening: This Transformation grows weaker when your energy reserves are low.
  –Effect: If your current Ki Point Pool is below 1/4 of your Maximum Ki Point Pool while in this Transformation, reduce this Transformation’s Attribute Modifier Bonuses (after all calculations) by 1/2. You do not suffer this effect if you have entered this Transformation through the effects of the Heartbeat Aspect.

---

